📑 Deliverables

✔ Detailed penetration testing documentation
✔ Screenshots of each phase
✔ Mitigation strategies for identified vulnerabilities
✔ Ethical and academic-focused implementation

⚖️ Disclaimer

This project is strictly for educational and ethical purposes.
No real-world systems, websites, or users were harmed or targeted.

